error[E0277]: `Tags` cannot be encrypted into one `Ciphertext`
  --> tests/ui/scalar_derived_not_one_value.rs:24:28
   |
24 |     let _ = keyset.encrypt(Tags(vec!["admin".into()]));
   |                            ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ `keyset.encrypt` encrypts one owned value
